From 0f4e2ee9cd0ae40d7ef69f19a08a9b3ba647e3f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 22:07:07 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] chore: rebase the repository reshape onto the
 MandateToken work (#301)

Resolves the overlap with S2-A: the a-plan handoff joins docs/internal/handoff, the
readiness manifest digests are refreshed, the SDK types keep both the spec-derived
vocabulary and the MandateToken surface, and the pdp-spec JSON Schema generator now
writes prettier-formatted output so the committed schema, the format gate and the
Python type generator's digest agree.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WQXeE9sJQ4CozZNuH73SFQ
